  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mangrove Rehabilitation for Landscape-Based Community Welfare Project in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Develop rehabilitation models, such as silvofishery, abraded mangrove, disturbed mangrove), and develop utilization of mangrove models, ecotourism and Non-Timber Forest Products to increase the income of coastal communities). 2. Developing Mangrove Rehabilitation Center, as a learning center in the rehabilitation and utilization of mangroves in Indonesia. In this center, there will be seedbed locations, educational facilities and infrastructure as well as mangrove exhibitions related to mangrove rehabilitation. 3. Establishment information and knowledge of mangrove rehabilitation/management. The activities carried out are in the form of providing and disseminating information related to best practices for rehabilitation and mangrove utilization through various</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To develop mangrove rehabilitation and utilization model in some types of land use, 2. To develop mangrove rehabilitation center, 3. Knowledge management of mangrove rehabilitation, management&#x25A3; &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD55C; &#xB9F9;&#xADF8;&#xB85C;&#xBE0C; &#xC232; &#xBCF5;&#xC6D0; &#xBAA8;&#xB378; &#xC218;&#xB9BD;
